WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:03.069
-Guys, I heard that the TV
ratings for Trump's rallies

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:04.537 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
have gone down.

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:05.905 line:92%
People are saying his rallies

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:08.008 size:81% position:41%
are like "Pirates of
the Caribbean" movies.

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:08.842 line:92%
They're wild and new at first,

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:11.211 align:start size:94% position:6%
then you realize
they're all exactly the same.

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:12.278 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Anyway...

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:13.380 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:14.948 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:15.548 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Boring.

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:18.084
But the midterm elections
are under a month away,

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:20.653 size:88% position:44%
and Trump's campaign is
selling football jerseys

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:22.489 line:92%
that say "Stand Up for America."

00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:25.291 size:84% position:42%
Yeah, the outside says,
"Stand Up for America,"

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:27.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
while the inside says,
"Made in China."

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:28.895 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Really?

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:30.397 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:00:30.397 --> 00:00:31.131 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Check this out.

00:00:31.131 --> 00:00:32.932 align:start size:94% position:6%
I heard that Trump
keeps a printed list

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:35.135 align:start size:94% position:6%
of his accomplishments
that he shows to reporters

00:00:35.135 --> 00:00:38.238 align:start size:94% position:6%
to get them to write
positive things about him.

00:00:38.238 --> 00:00:39.139 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
He does.

00:00:39.139 --> 00:00:40.273 size:88% position:44% line:92%
It has 58 bullet points,

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:42.142 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we actually
got our hands on it.

00:00:42.142 --> 00:00:42.809 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Take a look at this.

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:44.711 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Appointed two
Supreme Court justices.

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:45.845 line:92%
Increased military spending.

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:46.813 line:92%
Lowered taxes for millionaires.

00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:48.381 size:75% position:38%
Fired Michael Flynn.
Fired Sally Yates.

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:50.216 align:start size:94% position:6%
Fired James Comey.
Fired Reince Priebus.

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:51.885 align:start size:94% position:6%
Fired Steve Bannon.
Fired Rex Tillerson.

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:53.920 align:start size:94% position:6%
Fired David Shulkin.
Hired Anthony Scaramucci.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:56.356 align:start size:94% position:6%
Fired Anthony Scaramucci.
Fired H.R. McMaster.

00:00:56.356 --> 00:00:57.524 align:start size:94% position:6%
Fired Andrew McCabe.
Fired Omarosa.

00:00:57.524 --> 00:01:00.093
-All right. I got it. I got it.
I got it. I got it.

00:01:00.093 --> 00:01:01.661 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:01.661 --> 00:01:04.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
He hired Scaramucci.
-Yeah, then he fired him.

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:07.500
-Oh, this week, former New York
Mayor Mike Bloomberg

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:11.237
switched his voter registration
and became a Democrat.

00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:12.372 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light applause ]

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:14.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
When asked him
what made him change parties,

00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:16.676 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Bloomberg said, "Kanye."

00:01:16.676 --> 00:01:17.844 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.844 --> 00:01:22.515
Speaking of New York, there's
a hospital here in the city

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:25.151 align:start size:94% position:6%
that keeps a Spotify playlist
full of songs

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:28.855 size:88% position:44%
with beats that match up
with CPR compressions.

00:01:28.855 --> 00:01:31.024 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause when you're having
a heart attack,

00:01:31.024 --> 00:01:32.392 align:start size:94% position:6%
who doesn't want to hear
their doctor say,

00:01:32.392 --> 00:01:34.327 align:start size:94% position:6%
"So what do you think,
Drake or Migos?

00:01:34.327 --> 00:01:36.863 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sorry, we weren't
talking about you.

00:01:36.863 --> 00:01:40.133 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oops, I put on...
Sorry, you're dead."

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:42.135 line:92%
Get this -- a cheating scandal

00:01:42.135 --> 00:01:44.871 align:start size:94% position:6%
has rocked the world
of wine tasting.

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:46.039 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-What?!

00:01:46.039 --> 00:01:49.576 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Please, don't leave the room.
This is a true --

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:52.112
That's right. It's rocked
the world of wine tasting.

00:01:52.112 --> 00:01:54.714 align:start size:94% position:6%
A cheating scandal came out
that some tasters

00:01:54.714 --> 00:01:56.449 align:start size:94% position:6%
were given the answers
to an exam.

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:59.919 align:start size:94% position:6%
The wine tasters say
that they are embarrassed,

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:03.556 align:start size:94% position:6%
a little humiliated,
and there's a hint of shame.

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:05.892 size:81% position:41% line:92%
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:02:05.892 --> 00:02:08.461 align:start size:94% position:6%
Long walk.
-Long walk.

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:10.930 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was worth it when
we got there, wasn't it?

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:11.998 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Come on.

00:02:11.998 --> 00:02:14.000 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
The longest joke of the night.
Yeah.

00:02:16.603 --> 00:02:19.139 align:start size:94% position:6%
Little taste of shame there.
-Ooh, shame.

00:02:19.139 --> 00:02:19.839 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:02:19.839 --> 00:02:21.407 align:start size:94% position:6%
You guys, the news
is so crazy lately,

00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:22.809 align:start size:94% position:6%
sometimes it almost
feels like someone

00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:24.344 align:start size:94% position:6%
blended a bunch of
stories together.

00:02:24.344 --> 00:02:26.546
So we thought, what if we
took some real headlines

00:02:26.546 --> 00:02:27.313 line:92%
and blended them together?

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:30.316
Would the news stories be any
crazier than the actual news?

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:30.950 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Let's find out.

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:34.521
If you blend the stories "Kanye
and Kid Rock Reveal Music Bill,"

00:02:34.521 --> 00:02:37.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
