DNA Test Reveals

00:02:42.295 --> 00:02:44.497 align:start size:94% position:6%
Kid Rock is Kanye's
Funky White Sister."

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:47.233
You see what I'm saying?
-Yeah, that's just crazy.

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:49.769 align:start size:94% position:6%
-A little bit crazier than --
-Just a tiny bit.

00:02:49.769 --> 00:02:51.171 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Next up,
if you blend the stories

00:02:51.171 --> 00:02:53.640 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Celebrity Couple
Gets Matching Tattoos,"

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:55.708 line:92%
"Nicki Minaj Faces Lawsuit,"

00:02:55.708 --> 00:02:56.709 line:92%
and "Very High Ticket Prices

00:02:56.709 --> 00:02:58.344 align:start size:94% position:6%
for Bill and Hillary Clinton's
Tour,"

00:02:58.344 --> 00:03:00.513 align:start size:94% position:6%
you get "Very High
Bill and Hillary Clinton

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:03.716 align:start size:94% position:6%
Get Matching Face Tattoos
of Nicki Minaj."

00:03:03.716 --> 00:03:06.386 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:03:06.386 --> 00:03:08.021 size:75% position:38% line:92%
