00:03:20.466 --> 00:03:22.435 align:start size:94% position:6%
Erupts Yellow Geyser
in Trash Can."

00:03:22.435 --> 00:03:25.605 align:start size:94% position:6%
You see what I'm saying?
-A little bit.

